# Post-mortem: kv writes down (first draft)

## Summary
Writes to the kv service failed for about 20 minutes because Rui was slow to respond and
the compaction job filled the disk. Obviously the disk should have been cleaned earlier.

## Impact
All writes failed. Reads were fine.

## Timeline
- 02:00 compaction started
- 02:14 writes start failing
- 02:21 Rui finally acknowledged the page
- 02:34 kv-1 restarted [chat]
- 03:01 temp file deleted

## Root cause and contributing factors
Human error: the on-call engineer was asleep and the storage team forgot to watch the disk ticket.

## What went well
Mia restarted kv-1 quickly.

## Action items
- Be more careful with disk space
- Rui to set a louder phone alarm
- Fix compaction owner: storage due: next quarter
